span id="lstnumberx19.108" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;">.</span>
</div>
</div>
</figure>
<section id="S6.SS1.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Scene Domain Specific Language</h4>

<div id="S6.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S6.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Here, we detail the types of descriptors defined in our Scene DSL.
The <span id="S6.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Category</span> descriptor, <math id="S6.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝑪</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C</annotation></semantics></math>, specifies the type of the scene element, where <math id="S6.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C\in\{\text{floors},\text{walls},\text{ceilings},\text{objects}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝑪</mi><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mtext>floors</mtext><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">,</mo><mtext>walls</mtext><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">,</mo><mtext>ceilings</mtext><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">,</mo><mtext>objects</mtext></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C\in\{\text{floors},\text{walls},\text{ceilings},\text{objects}\}</annotation></semantics></math>. The <span id="S6.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Placement</span> descriptor, <math id="S6.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="P=[(x,y,z),\theta_{z},s]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝑷</mi><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">=</mo><mrow><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold" stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold" stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒙</mi><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">,</mo><mi>𝒚</mi><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">,</mo><mi>𝒛</mi><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">,</mo><msub><mi>𝜽</mi><mi>𝒛</mi></msub><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">,</mo><mi>𝒔</mi></mrow><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold" stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P=[(x,y,z),\theta_{z},s]</annotation></semantics></math>, defines the spatial attributes of the element, where <math id="S6.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(x,y,z)\in\mathbb{R}^{3}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold" stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒙</mi><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">,</mo><mi>𝒚</mi><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">,</mo><mi>𝒛</mi><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mn>𝟑</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(x,y,z)\in\mathbb{R}^{3}</annotation></semantics></math> specifies the position in 3D space, <math id="S6.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta_{z}\in[0,2\pi]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝜽</mi><mi>𝒛</mi></msub><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">∈</mo><mrow><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold" stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>𝟎</mn><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">,</mo><mrow><mn>𝟐</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝝅</mi></mrow></mrow><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold" stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta_{z}\in[0,2\pi]</annotation></semantics></math> represents the rotation around the z-axis, and <math id="S6.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s\in\mathbb{R}^{3}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝒔</mi><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mn>𝟑</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s\in\mathbb{R}^{3}</annotation></semantics></math> is the scale of the element. Placement can include a list of such tuples to allow for multiple placements of a particular scene element. The <span id="S6.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Material</span> descriptor, <math id="S6.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M=\text{desc}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝑴</mi><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">=</mo><mtext>desc</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M=\text{desc}</annotation></semantics></math>, provides a natural language description (<math id="S6.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{desc}\in\text{NL}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext>desc</mtext><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">∈</mo><mtext>NL</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{desc}\in\text{NL}</annotation></semantics></math>) of the element’s surface properties. The <span id="S6.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Lighting</span> descriptor, <math id="S6.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L=(t,i,c)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝑳</mi><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">=</mo><mrow><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold" stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒕</mi><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">,</mo><mi>𝒊</mi><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">,</mo><mi>𝒄</mi><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L=(t,i,c)</annotation></semantics></math>, specifies the type of the light, <math id="S6.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\in\{\text{point},\text{directional},\text{area}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝒕</mi><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mtext>point</mtext><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">,</mo><mtext>directional</mtext><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">,</mo><mtext>area</mtext></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\in\{\text{point},\text{directional},\text{area}\}</annotation></semantics></math>, along with its intensity <math id="S6.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\in\mathbb{R}^{+}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝒊</mi><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\in\mathbb{R}^{+}</annotation></semantics></math> and color <math id="S6.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c\in\mathbb{R}^{3}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝒄</mi><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mn>𝟑</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c\in\mathbb{R}^{3}</annotation></semantics></math>, where <math id="S6.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c=(r,g,b)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝒄</mi><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">=</mo><mrow><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold" stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒓</mi><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">,</mo><mi>𝒈</mi><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">,</mo><mi>𝒃</mi><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c=(r,g,b)</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="S6.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r,g,b\in[0,1]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝒓</mi><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">,</mo><mi>𝒈</mi><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">,</mo><mrow><mi>𝒃</mi><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">∈</mo><mrow><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold" stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>𝟎</mn><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">,</mo><mn>𝟏</mn></mrow><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold" stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r,g,b\in[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math> represent the normalized RGB color values. Finally, the <span id="S6.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Metadata</span> descriptor, <math id="S6.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝑫</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D</annotation></semantics></math>, captures additional category-specific attributes, details of which are provided in the supplementary materials. Below, we provide the implementation in Python:</p>
</div>
<figure id="S6.SS1.SSS0.Px1.tab1" class="ltx_float ltx_lstlisting">
<div id="S6.SS1.SSS0.Px1.tab1.1" class="ltx_listing ltx_lstlisting ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="programs/scene˙def.txt">⬇</a></div>
<div id="lstnumberx20" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx20.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;">from</span><span id="lstnumberx20.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx20.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;">pydantic</span><span id="lstnumberx20.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx20.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;">import</span><span id="lstnumberx20.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx20.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;">BaseModel</span><span id="lstnumberx20.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;">,</span><span id="lstnumberx20.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx20.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;">Field</span><span id="lstnumberx20.11" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;">,</span><span id="lstnumberx20.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx20.13" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;">conint</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx21" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx21.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;">from</span><span id="lstnumberx21.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx21.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;">typing</span><span id="lstnumberx21.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx21.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;">import</span><span id="lstnumberx21.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx21.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;">List</span><span id="lstnumberx21.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;">,</span><span id="lstnumberx21.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx21.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;">Optional</span><span id="lstnumberx21.11" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;">,</span><span id="lstnumberx21.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx21.13" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;">Dict</span><span id="lstnumberx21.14" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;">,</span><span id="lstnumberx21.15" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx21.16" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;">Literal</span><span id="lstnumberx21.17" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;">,</span><span id="lstnumberx21.18" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx21.19" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;">Any</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx22" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx22.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;">import</span><span id="lstnumberx22.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx22.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;">math</span>
</div>
